  <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,7vw,2.8rem);">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>

  <div class="answer-first">
    <span class="af-label">In short</span>
    <p>Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you sign up through one, we may be paid a commission at no cost to you. Compensation never affects a rating, a ranking, or a measured figure, and affiliate links are never shown to visitors in states where the operator is unavailable.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>How we are paid</h2>
  <p>We may receive a commission when a reader clicks an affiliate link and creates an account with an operator. This is the only commercial relationship we have with the operators we cover. Operators do not pay for coverage, do not review articles before publication, and are never told when they are being tested.</p>

  <h2>Our partners</h2>
  <p>We currently hold affiliate agreements with the following operators: <strong>Jackpota</strong> (jackpota.com), <strong>Lucky Bunny</strong> (luckybunny.fun), <strong>YAY Casino</strong> (yaycasino.com), <strong>Dorados</strong> (dorados.com), and <strong>Zonko</strong> (zonko.com). These are the only operators with affiliate links on this site, and the only ones marked "Partner" in our comparison tables. See the <a href="/disclaimer/">full disclaimer</a> for availability and eligibility notices.</p>

  <h2>What affiliate links do not influence</h2>
  <ul class="tick-list">
    <li><b>Measured figures.</b> Redemption times and verification requirements come from funded tests or cited terms of service. A commercial relationship cannot change a timestamp.</li>
    <li><b>Status labels.</b> An operator with no completed test stays labeled pending regardless of any affiliate agreement.</li>
    <li><b>Rankings.</b> No ranking exists until at least three comparable tests complete, per our <a href="/methodology/">methodology</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>State eligibility gate</h2>
  <p>Editorial research is public in every state. Affiliate links stay hidden until you select a state, and are blocked entirely for states where the category is closed by statute or enforcement. Your selection is stored in a 30-day cookie on your device; nothing is sent to us. See the <a href="/availability/">state availability list</a> for the current rules.</p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>Contact the research team through the author page: <a href="/authors/alex-rowan/">Alex Rowan</a>.</p>
